<code>assert ((HashSet)\result).size() == this.size();</code>
--------------------
Looking at the comment: "The cloned set has the same size as the original set."

The method returns the cloned set (`\result`), and `this` is the original set. The observer method `size()` gives the cardinality.

<code>assert \result.size() == this.size();</code>
